stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Current: ingest<br/>version 1
    Current --> Current: ingest changed content<br/>new version indexed
    Current --> Tombstone: delete<br/>hidden at once
    Tombstone --> Current: ingest again<br/>revived
    Tombstone --> Erased: purge(ids) or retention expiry
    Current --> Erased: purge(ids)
    Erased --> [*]

    note right of Current
        Updates keep version history
        according to retention settings.
    end note
    note right of Erased
        Purge physically erases the
        document and its related records.
    end note
